{"id":4,"title":"Expressions — Fundamentals","subject":"algebra","sections":[{"id":"expression-foundation","title":"Terms, brackets, and identities","kind":"learn","steps":[{"kind":"video","id":"expression-basics","minutes":7.5,"title":"Expressions — Fundamentals"},{"kind":"video","id":"r26-t04-formulas","minutes":5.7,"title":"Contracted Multiplication Formulas"},{"kind":"card","id":"mem-formulas","title":"Contracted multiplication formulas","intro":"Use them forward to expand and backward to factor. They also find values without finding the letters.","tables":[{"title":"","head":["Formula","Example"],"rows":[["\\((a+b)^2=a^2+2ab+b^2\\)","\\((3+2)^2=9+12+4=25\\)"],["\\((a-b)^2=a^2-2ab+b^2\\)","\\((5-3)^2=25-30+9=4\\)"],["\\((a-b)(a+b)=a^2-b^2\\)","\\(48\\cdot52=50^2-2^2=2500-4=2496\\)"],["\\(a^2+b^2=(a+b)^2-2ab\\)","\\(a+b=7\\) and \\(ab=10\\): \\(a^2+b^2=49-20=29\\)"],["\\(\\left(x+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^2=x^2+2+\\frac{1}{x^2}\\)","\\(x+\\frac{1}{x}=3\\): \\(x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}=9-2=7\\)"],["\\(ka+kb=k(a+b)\\)","\\(6x+15=3(2x+5)\\); \\(x(a+b)+3(a+b)=(a+b)(x+3)\\)"],["\\(-(b-c)=-b+c\\)","a minus before a bracket flips every sign"]]}],"tips":["\\((a+b)^2\\ne a^2+b^2\\) — the middle term \\(2ab\\) is the whole point.","Power first: \\(3(x+3)^2=3(x^2+6x+9)=3x^2+18x+27\\), not \\((3x+9)^2\\).","\\(-x^2\\) is not \\((-x)^2\\): for \\(x=3\\), \\(-x^2=-9\\) but \\((-x)^2=9\\).","\\((b-a)^2=(a-b)^2\\), but \\(b-a=-(a-b)\\), and \\(\\frac{a-b}{b-a}=-1\\) (when \\(a\\ne b\\)).","Perfect square? (1) first and last terms are squares, (2) middle term \\(=2\\cdot\\)first\\(\\cdot\\)last, (3) its sign goes into the bracket.","\\(a\\cdot a^3=a^4\\): count the factors of \\(a\\) (\\(1+3=4\\))."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-120","stem":"\\((m+n)^2-(m-n)^2=?\\)","choices":["\\(0\\)","\\(4mn\\)","\\(2n^2\\)","\\(m^2-n^2\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Expand both squares and keep the second one in brackets: \\((m^2+2mn+n^2)-(m^2-2mn+n^2)\\).","The minus flips every sign in the second bracket: \\(m^2+2mn+n^2-m^2+2mn-n^2=4mn\\) (choice 2).","Choice 3 (\\(2n^2\\)) is what you get when the minus reaches only the \\(m^2\\). Choice 1 (\\(0\\)) comes from \\((m+n)^2=m^2+n^2\\) — a mistake.","Check with \\(m=3\\), \\(n=2\\): \\(5^2-1^2=25-1=24\\), and \\(4\\cdot3\\cdot2=24\\). The other choices give \\(0\\), \\(8\\) and \\(5\\)."],"number":1},{"kind":"video","id":"solve-q-120","minutes":1.7,"solution":true,"questionId":"q-120","title":"Worked solution · Question 1"},{"kind":"question","id":"q-121","stem":"\\((x-3)(x+3)-(y-3)(y+3)=?\\)","choices":["\\(x+y\\)","\\(x^2-y^2\\)","\\(x^2-y^2-18\\)","\\(0\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Each product is a difference of squares: \\((x-3)(x+3)=x^2-9\\) and \\((y-3)(y+3)=y^2-9\\).","Subtract, keeping the brackets: \\((x^2-9)-(y^2-9)=x^2-9-y^2+9=x^2-y^2\\) (choice 2).","Choice 3 (\\(x^2-y^2-18\\)) forgets that the minus also flips the \\(-9\\).","Check with \\(x=4\\), \\(y=5\\): \\(1\\cdot7-2\\cdot8=7-16=-9\\), and \\(16-25=-9\\)."],"number":2},{"kind":"video","id":"solve-q-121","minutes":1.1,"solution":true,"questionId":"q-121","title":"Worked solution · Question 2"},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-02","stem":"\\(51^2-49^2=?\\)","choices":["\\(2\\)","\\(4\\)","\\(100\\)","\\(200\\)"],"correct":3,"explanation":["Use the difference of squares: \\(a^2-b^2=(a-b)(a+b)\\).","\\(51^2-49^2=(51-49)(51+49)=2\\cdot100=200\\) (choice 4).","The long way gives the same: \\(2601-2401=200\\). Choice 2 (\\(4\\)) is \\((51-49)^2\\), a different expression."],"number":3},{"kind":"video","id":"solve-q-r26-t04-02","minutes":0.8,"solution":true,"questionId":"q-r26-t04-02","title":"Worked solution · Question 3"},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-03","stem":"Which of the following expressions is equal to \\((a-b)^2\\) for all values of \\(a\\) and \\(b\\)?","choices":["\\(a^2-b^2\\)","\\((b-a)^2\\)","\\(-(b-a)^2\\)","\\(a^2+b^2\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["\\(b-a\\) is the opposite of \\(a-b\\): \\(b-a=-(a-b)\\).","Squaring removes the minus: \\((b-a)^2=(-1)^2(a-b)^2=(a-b)^2\\) (choice 2).","Check with \\(a=5\\), \\(b=2\\): \\((a-b)^2=9\\). The choices give \\(21\\), \\(9\\), \\(-9\\) and \\(29\\). Only choice 2 gives \\(9\\).","In choice 3 the minus is outside the square. Nothing removes it."],"number":4},{"kind":"video","id":"solve-q-r26-t04-03","minutes":0.7,"solution":true,"questionId":"q-r26-t04-03","title":"Worked solution · Question 4"},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-01","stem":"Given:\n\\(\\begin{cases} x+y=6 \\\\ xy=5 \\end{cases}\\)\nWhat is the value of \\(x^2+y^2\\)?","choices":["\\(36\\)","\\(31\\)","\\(26\\)","\\(46\\)"],"correct":2,"explanation":["Square the sum: \\((x+y)^2=x^2+2xy+y^2\\).","Substitute: \\(6^2=x^2+y^2+2\\cdot5\\), that is, \\(36=x^2+y^2+10\\).","Therefore \\(x^2+y^2=36-10=26\\) (choice 3).","Check: \\(x=1\\) and \\(y=5\\) fit both conditions, and \\(1^2+5^2=1+25=26\\). Choice 1 (\\(36\\)) is the trap: it forgets the middle term \\(2xy\\)."],"number":5},{"kind":"video","id":"solve-q-r26-t04-01","minutes":1.0,"solution":true,"questionId":"q-r26-t04-01","title":"Worked solution · Question 5"},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-04","stem":"Given: \\(x+\\frac{1}{x}=3\\) (\\(x\\ne0\\)).\nWhat is the value of \\(x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}\\)?","choices":["\\(7\\)","\\(9\\)","\\(11\\)","\\(5\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Square both sides: \\(\\left(x+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^2=3^2=9\\).","Expand: \\(x^2+2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{x^2}=x^2+2+\\frac{1}{x^2}\\), because \\(x\\cdot\\frac{1}{x}=1\\).","Therefore \\(x^2+2+\\frac{1}{x^2}=9\\), and \\(x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}=9-2=7\\) (choice 1).","Choice 2 (\\(9\\)) forgets the middle term \\(2\\); choice 3 (\\(11\\)) adds it instead of subtracting it."],"number":6},{"kind":"video","id":"solve-q-r26-t04-04","minutes":0.9,"solution":true,"questionId":"q-r26-t04-04","title":"Worked solution · Question 6"},{"kind":"video","id":"r26-t04-summary","minutes":2.2,"title":"Expressions: Summary"}]},{"id":"unit-t4-1","title":"Independent practice","kind":"practice","steps":[{"kind":"question","id":"q-100","stem":"\\(9a+4b-5a-b=?\\)","choices":["\\(4(a+b)\\)","\\(3a+4b\\)","\\(4a+5b\\)","\\(4a+3b\\)"],"correct":3,"explanation":["Collect like terms: \\(9a-5a=4a\\) and \\(4b-b=3b\\) (a plain b is \\(1b\\)). The result is \\(4a+3b\\) (choice 4)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"alg-extra-unit-t4-1-1","stem":"\\(3x+5y-2x-3y=?\\)","choices":["\\(x+8y\\)","\\(3xy\\)","\\(x+2y\\)","\\(5x+8y\\)"],"correct":2,"explanation":["Collect like terms: \\(3x-2x=x\\) and \\(5y-3y=2y\\).","The result is \\(x+2y\\) (choice 3)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-102","stem":"\\((-2x)\\cdot7z\\cdot3y=?\\)","choices":["\\(-21xyz\\)","\\(-42xyz\\)","\\(-xyz\\)","\\(-14xyz\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Numbers with numbers: \\((-2)\\cdot7\\cdot3=-42\\). Letters with letters: \\(x\\cdot z\\cdot y=xyz\\).","The result is \\(-42xyz\\) (choice 2)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-103","stem":"\\(4\\cdot(-a)\\cdot a^2\\cdot(-3a)=?\\)","choices":["\\(12a^3\\)","\\(-12a^4\\)","\\(-12a^3\\)","\\(12a^4\\)"],"correct":3,"explanation":["Numbers: \\(4\\cdot(-1)\\cdot(-3)=12\\). Two minus signs give a plus.","Letters: count the factors of \\(a\\). \\(a\\cdot a^2\\cdot a\\) has \\(1+2+1=4\\) of them. It is \\(a^4\\).","The result is \\(12a^4\\) (choice 4)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-104","stem":"\\(2xy\\cdot5x^2y\\cdot(-3y^2)=?\\)","choices":["\\(-10x^3y^4\\)","\\(-30x^3y^4\\)","\\(-30x^3y^3\\)","\\(-30x^4y^3\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Numbers: \\(2\\cdot5\\cdot(-3)=-30\\).","Count the factors of \\(x\\): \\(x\\cdot x^2=x^3\\). Count the factors of \\(y\\): \\(y\\cdot y\\cdot y^2=y^4\\).","The result is \\(-30x^3y^4\\) (choice 2)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-101","stem":"\\(-2\\sqrt{3}-5\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{7}+4\\sqrt{3}=?\\)","choices":["\\(2\\sqrt{3}-4\\sqrt{7}\\)","\\(2\\sqrt{3}-5\\sqrt{7}\\)","\\(6\\sqrt{3}-4\\sqrt{7}\\)","\\(2\\sqrt{3}+4\\sqrt{7}\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Treat \\(\\sqrt{3}\\) and \\(\\sqrt{7}\\) like two different letters.","\\(\\sqrt{3}\\) terms: \\(-2\\sqrt{3}+4\\sqrt{3}=2\\sqrt{3}\\). \\(\\sqrt{7}\\) terms: \\(-5\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{7}=-4\\sqrt{7}\\).","Together: \\(2\\sqrt{3}-4\\sqrt{7}\\) (choice 1)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-105","stem":"\\(-5(2x-3)=?\\)","choices":["\\(10x-15\\)","\\(-10x-15\\)","\\(-10x+15\\)","\\(10x+15\\)"],"correct":2,"explanation":["The \\(-5\\) multiplies every term: \\(-5\\cdot2x=-10x\\) and \\(-5\\cdot(-3)=+15\\).","The result is \\(-10x+15\\) (choice 3)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"alg-extra-unit-t4-1-2","stem":"\\(3(x+4)-2(x+1)=?\\)","choices":["\\(x+10\\)","\\(x+8\\)","\\(5x+10\\)","\\(x+13\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Open both brackets. The \\(-2\\) multiplies both terms: \\(3x+12-2x-2\\).","Collect: \\(3x-2x=x\\) and \\(12-2=10\\). The result is \\(x+10\\) (choice 1)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-107","stem":"\\((2x-y)-(y-2x)=?\\)","choices":["\\(4x\\)","\\(0\\)","\\(-2y\\)","\\(4x-2y\\)"],"correct":3,"explanation":["The minus before the second bracket flips both signs: \\(2x-y-y+2x\\).","Collect: \\(4x-2y\\) (choice 4)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-108","stem":"\\((5s-2t)-(-2t+5s)=?\\)","choices":["\\(0\\)","\\(-4t\\)","\\(10s\\)","\\(10s-4t\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["The two brackets hold the same expression: \\(-2t+5s\\) is \\(5s-2t\\) written in the other order.","The minus flips both signs of the second bracket: \\(5s-2t+2t-5s=0\\) (choice 1)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-109","stem":"\\((-2b+a)-(-a-2b)=?\\)","choices":["\\(-4b\\)","\\(2a-4b\\)","\\(2a\\)","\\(0\\)"],"correct":2,"explanation":["The minus flips both signs of the second bracket: \\(-2b+a+a+2b\\).","The b terms cancel and the a terms add up: \\(2a\\) (choice 3)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-110","stem":"\\((3r-s)-\\big(-s-(-3r)\\big)=?\\)","choices":["\\(6r\\)","\\(0\\)","\\(6r-2s\\)","\\(-2s\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Work from the inside out: \\(-(-3r)=+3r\\). The second bracket is \\(-s+3r\\).","Then \\((3r-s)-(-s+3r)=3r-s+s-3r=0\\) (choice 2)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-111","stem":"\\((5x+2)^2=?\\)","choices":["\\(25x^2+10x+4\\)","\\(25x^2+20x+4\\)","\\(25x^2+4\\)","\\(25x^2+40x+4\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Use \\((a+b)^2=a^2+2ab+b^2\\) with \\(a=5x\\) and \\(b=2\\).","\\((5x)^2=25x^2\\), \\(2\\cdot5x\\cdot2=20x\\), \\(2^2=4\\). The result is \\(25x^2+20x+4\\) (choice 2)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-114","stem":"\\((3x-4)^2=?\\)","choices":["\\(9x^2-24x+16\\)","\\(9x^2-16\\)","\\(9x^2-24x-16\\)","\\(9x^2+16\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Use \\((a-b)^2=a^2-2ab+b^2\\) with \\(a=3x\\) and \\(b=4\\).","\\((3x)^2=9x^2\\), \\(2\\cdot3x\\cdot4=24x\\), \\(4^2=16\\). The result is \\(9x^2-24x+16\\) (choice 1)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-117","stem":"\\((x-9)(x+9)=?\\)","choices":["\\(x^2+81\\)","\\(x^2-81\\)","\\(x^2-18x-81\\)","\\(x^2-81x-81\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Difference of squares: \\((a-b)(a+b)=a^2-b^2\\) with \\(a=x\\) and \\(b=9\\).","\\(x^2-9^2=x^2-81\\) (choice 2). There is no middle term."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-112","stem":"\\(4(x+2)^2=?\\)","choices":["\\(4x^2+16\\)","\\(16x^2+64\\)","\\(4x^2+16x+16\\)","\\(16x^2+64x+64\\)"],"correct":2,"explanation":["Power first: \\((x+2)^2=x^2+4x+4\\).","Then multiply every term by \\(4\\): \\(4x^2+16x+16\\) (choice 3).","Choice 4 is \\((4x+8)^2\\): it puts the \\(4\\) inside the square. That is a mistake."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-118","stem":"\\(3(x-4)(x+4)=?\\)","choices":["\\(3x^2+48\\)","\\(3x^2-24x-48\\)","\\(3x^2-12x-48\\)","\\(3x^2-48\\)"],"correct":3,"explanation":["Brackets first, with the difference of squares: \\((x-4)(x+4)=x^2-16\\).","Then multiply by \\(3\\): \\(3x^2-48\\) (choice 4)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-113","stem":"Which of the following is equal to \\(x^2+16x+64\\)?","choices":["\\((x+8)^2\\)","\\((x+4)^2\\)","\\((x+16)^2\\)","\\(8(x+2)^2\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Check the perfect-square pattern: \\(64=8^2\\), and the middle term is \\(2\\cdot x\\cdot8=16x\\).","Both checks pass. Therefore \\(x^2+16x+64=(x+8)^2\\) (choice 1)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-116","stem":"Which of the following is equal to \\(25x^2+9-30x\\)?","choices":["\\((-5x-3)^2\\)","\\(5(x-3)^2\\)","\\(5(-x-3)^2\\)","\\((5x-3)^2\\)"],"correct":3,"explanation":["Put the terms in order: \\(25x^2-30x+9\\).","Check: \\(25x^2=(5x)^2\\) and \\(9=3^2\\). The middle term: \\(2\\cdot5x\\cdot3=30x\\), with a minus.","Therefore \\(25x^2-30x+9=(5x-3)^2\\) (choice 4)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-119","stem":"Which of the following is equal to \\(36-25x^2\\)?","choices":["\\((6-5x)^2\\)","\\((6-5x)(6+5x)\\)","\\((6+5x)^2\\)","\\((6-\\sqrt{5}x)(6+\\sqrt{5}x)\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["A difference of squares: \\(36=6^2\\) and \\(25x^2=(5x)^2\\).","Therefore \\(36-25x^2=(6-5x)(6+5x)\\) (choice 2)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"alg-extra-unit-t4-1-5","stem":"\\(97\\cdot103=?\\)","choices":["\\(9997\\)","\\(9991\\)","\\(10009\\)","\\(9994\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["\\(97\\) and \\(103\\) are both \\(3\\) away from \\(100\\): \\(97\\cdot103=(100-3)(100+3)\\).","Difference of squares: \\(100^2-3^2=10000-9=9991\\) (choice 2)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"alg-extra-unit-t4-1-6","stem":"\\((u+v)(w-3)+(u+v)(w+3)=?\\)","choices":["\\(0\\)","\\(2w(u+v)\\)","\\(6(u+v)\\)","\\(2w+u+v\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["The bracket \\(u+v\\) is a common factor: \\((u+v)\\big[(w-3)+(w+3)\\big]\\).","Inside: \\(w-3+w+3=2w\\). The result is \\(2w(u+v)\\) (choice 2)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"alg-extra-unit-t4-1-7","stem":"Given: \\(x\\ne0\\).\nWhich of the following is equal to \\(\\frac{3x^2+15x}{3x}\\)?","choices":["\\(x+5\\)","\\(3x+5\\)","\\(x+15\\)","\\(x^2+5\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Take out the common factor \\(3x\\) on the top: \\(3x^2+15x=3x(x+5)\\).","Reduce \\(3x\\): \\(\\frac{3x(x+5)}{3x}=x+5\\) (choice 1)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"alg-extra-unit-t4-1-4","stem":"Given: \\(x\\ne3\\).\nWhich of the following is equal to \\(\\frac{x^2-9}{x-3}\\)?","choices":["\\(x\\)","\\(2x+3\\)","\\(x+3\\)","\\(x-3\\)"],"correct":2,"explanation":["Factor the top: \\(x^2-9=(x-3)(x+3)\\).","Reduce \\(x-3\\) (it is not zero): \\(\\frac{(x-3)(x+3)}{x-3}=x+3\\) (choice 3)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-115","stem":"\\((c-d)^2-(c+d)^2=?\\)","choices":["\\(-4cd\\)","\\(2c^2-2d^2\\)","\\(0\\)","\\(4cd\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Expand both squares and keep the second in brackets: \\((c^2-2cd+d^2)-(c^2+2cd+d^2)\\).","Open the brackets: \\(c^2-2cd+d^2-c^2-2cd-d^2=-4cd\\) (choice 1).","Check with \\(c=3\\), \\(d=2\\): \\(1-25=-24\\), and \\(-4\\cdot3\\cdot2=-24\\)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-106","stem":"\\((x-1)(x^4+x^3+x^2+x+1)=?\\)","choices":["\\(x^5\\)","\\(x^5-1\\)","\\(1\\)","\\(x^5+1\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Multiply \\(x\\) by every term: \\(x^5+x^4+x^3+x^2+x\\). Multiply \\(-1\\) by every term: \\(-x^4-x^3-x^2-x-1\\).","Add: \\(x^4\\), \\(x^3\\), \\(x^2\\) and \\(x\\) cancel in pairs. What is left is \\(x^5-1\\) (choice 2).","Faster: plug in \\(x=2\\). \\((2-1)(16+8+4+2+1)=31\\). The choices give \\(32\\), \\(31\\), \\(1\\) and \\(33\\). Only choice 2 gives \\(31\\)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"alg-extra-unit-t4-1-3","stem":"Which of the following is equal to \\(x^2+8x+15\\)?","choices":["\\((x+2)(x+6)\\)","\\((x-3)(x-5)\\)","\\((x+1)(x+15)\\)","\\((x+3)(x+5)\\)"],"correct":3,"explanation":["Open the choices. Each one is \\((x+p)(x+q)=x^2+(p+q)x+pq\\): the middle number is \\(p+q\\), the last number is \\(pq\\). We need \\(p+q=8\\) and \\(pq=15\\).","Choice 1: \\(2+6=8\\), but \\(2\\cdot6=12\\). Choice 2: \\((-3)+(-5)=-8\\). Choice 3: \\(1+15=16\\). Choice 4: \\(3+5=8\\) and \\(3\\cdot5=15\\). The answer is choice 4: \\(x^2+8x+15=(x+3)(x+5)\\).","Check with a number, \\(x=1\\): \\(1+8+15=24\\). The choices give \\(3\\cdot7=21\\), \\((-2)(-4)=8\\), \\(2\\cdot16=32\\) and \\(4\\cdot6=24\\). Only choice 4 gives \\(24\\).","The quick way (sum and product): two numbers with sum \\(8\\) and product \\(15\\) are \\(3\\) and \\(5\\)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-08","stem":"Given:\n\\(\\begin{cases} x+y=8 \\\\ x-y=2 \\end{cases}\\)\nWhat is the value of \\(x^2-y^2\\)?","choices":["\\(16\\)","\\(10\\)","\\(60\\)","\\(6\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Difference of squares: \\(x^2-y^2=(x+y)(x-y)=8\\cdot2=16\\) (choice 1).","Check: \\(x=5\\), \\(y=3\\) fit both conditions, and \\(25-9=16\\)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-09","stem":"\\(1001^2-999^2=?\\)","choices":["\\(2\\)","\\(4\\)","\\(2000\\)","\\(4000\\)"],"correct":3,"explanation":["Difference of squares: \\((1001-999)(1001+999)=2\\cdot2000=4000\\) (choice 4)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-07","stem":"Given:\n\\(\\begin{cases} a-b=3 \\\\ ab=4 \\end{cases}\\)\nWhat is the value of \\(a^2+b^2\\)?","choices":["\\(1\\)","\\(17\\)","\\(13\\)","\\(25\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Square the difference: \\((a-b)^2=a^2-2ab+b^2\\).","Substitute: \\(9=a^2+b^2-8\\). Therefore \\(a^2+b^2=9+8=17\\) (choice 2).","Check: \\(a=4\\), \\(b=1\\) fit both conditions, and \\(16+1=17\\)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-10","stem":"Given: \\(x+\\frac{1}{x}=4\\) (\\(x\\ne0\\)).\nWhat is the value of \\(x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}\\)?","choices":["\\(16\\)","\\(18\\)","\\(14\\)","\\(8\\)"],"correct":2,"explanation":["Square both sides: \\(x^2+2+\\frac{1}{x^2}=16\\), because \\(2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{1}{x}=2\\).","Therefore \\(x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}=16-2=14\\) (choice 3)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-14","stem":"\\((2a+b)^2-(2a-b)^2=?\\)","choices":["\\(8ab\\)","\\(4ab\\)","\\(2b^2\\)","\\(8a^2\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Expand: \\((4a^2+4ab+b^2)-(4a^2-4ab+b^2)=4ab+4ab=8ab\\) (choice 1).","Check with \\(a=2\\), \\(b=1\\): \\(5^2-3^2=16\\), and \\(8\\cdot2\\cdot1=16\\). The other choices give \\(8\\), \\(2\\) and \\(32\\)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-19","stem":"For every \\(x\\), \\((x+3)^2-(x-3)(x+3)=?\\)","choices":["\\(18\\)","\\(6x+18\\)","\\(6x\\)","\\(2x^2+6x+18\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Expand: \\((x+3)^2=x^2+6x+9\\) and \\((x-3)(x+3)=x^2-9\\).","Subtract, keeping brackets: \\(x^2+6x+9-(x^2-9)=6x+18\\) (choice 2).","Faster: plug in \\(x=1\\). \\(16-(-2)(4)=16+8=24\\). The choices give \\(18\\), \\(24\\), \\(6\\) and \\(26\\). Only choice 2 gives \\(24\\)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-16","stem":"\\(\\dfrac{2021^2-2019^2}{2020}=?\\)","choices":["\\(1\\)","\\(2\\)","\\(4\\)","\\(2020\\)"],"correct":2,"explanation":["Difference of squares on the top: \\((2021-2019)(2021+2019)=2\\cdot4040\\).","Divide: \\(\\frac{2\\cdot4040}{2020}=2\\cdot2=4\\) (choice 3)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-15","stem":"Given:\n\\(\\begin{cases} (a+b)^2=49 \\\\ (a-b)^2=9 \\end{cases}\\)\nWhat is the value of \\(ab\\)?","choices":["\\(40\\)","\\(10\\)","\\(20\\)","\\(29\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Subtract the two expansions: \\((a+b)^2-(a-b)^2=4ab\\).","So \\(4ab=49-9=40\\), and \\(ab=10\\) (choice 2).","Check: \\(a=5\\), \\(b=2\\) give \\((a+b)^2=49\\) and \\((a-b)^2=9\\), and \\(ab=10\\)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-18","stem":"Given:\n\\(\\begin{cases} x^2-y^2=24 \\\\ x+y=6 \\end{cases}\\)\nWhat is the value of \\(x\\)?","choices":["\\(4\\)","\\(5\\)","\\(1\\)","\\(3\\)"],"correct":1,"explanation":["Difference of squares: \\(x^2-y^2=(x+y)(x-y)\\). Therefore \\(24=6(x-y)\\) and \\(x-y=4\\).","Add the two equations \\(x+y=6\\) and \\(x-y=4\\): \\(2x=10\\) and \\(x=5\\) (choice 2).","Check: \\(y=1\\), and \\(25-1=24\\)."]},{"kind":"question","id":"q-r26-t04-17","stem":"Given: \\(x-y=5\\).\nWhat is the value of \\(x^2-2xy+y^2-2x+2y\\)?","choices":["\\(15\\)","\\(35\\)","\\(25\\)","\\(20\\)"],"correct":0,"explanation":["Group: \\(x^2-2xy+y^2=(x-y)^2\\) and \\(-2x+2y=-2(x-y)\\).","Substitute: \\(5^2-2\\cdot5=25-10=15\\) (choice 1).","Check with \\(x=5\\), \\(y=0\\): \\(25-0+0-10+0=15\\)."]}]}],"passages":{}}